  "title": "Community Bancorp. Reports Fourth Quarter and Full Year 2025 Financial Results",
  "summary": "DERBY, VT / ACCESS Newswire / January 27, 2026 / Community Bancorp. (OTCQX:CMTV), the parent company of Community National Bank (the \"Bank\"), reported consolidated earnings for the fourth quarter ended December 31, 2025, of $4.6 million or $0.83 per share, an increase of $536,850 or 13.10% compared to $4.1 million or $0.73 per share reported for the fourth quarter of 2024. Full year earnings for 2025 were $17 million or $3.01 per share, compared to $12.8 million or $2.28 per share for the prior",
